{
  "_readme": [
    "Every theme is defined by STRUCTURAL vocabulary, not by named events.",
    "'Sanctions', 'chokepoint', 'unplanned outage' and 'force majeure' will still be the",
    "language of a market-moving story in 2035. 'Russia/Ukraine' will not necessarily be.",
    "Named entities only appear where the entity is geographic or physical infrastructure",
    "that cannot move: straits, pipelines, terminals, basins, hubs.",
    "",
    "weight        = how much a hit in this theme contributes to the relevance score",
    "terms         = plain substring matches, case-insensitive, word-boundary aware",
    "phrases       = multi-word matches, scored higher than single terms",
    "requires_any  = optional gate. Theme only scores if one of these also appears.",
    "                Used to stop 'strike' (industrial action) matching 'strike' (military)",
    "                without context, and similar.",
    "",
    "To add a theme, copy the shape. To retire one, set active=false. No code changes."
  ],
